WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.406
Run the capture script with no device.

2
00:00:03.456 --> 00:00:10.169
It renders each registered screen with flutter test, then writes a small manifest.

3
00:00:10.219 --> 00:00:15.203
When it finishes, .scry/capture holds one image per screen.

4
00:00:15.253 --> 00:00:21.264
On an emulator or simulator the script is the same, with android or ios.

